# The Mono runtime build.sh builds: gex's fork of dotnet/runtime, branch gex
# (v10.0.3, r58Playz/dotnet-runtime's runtime wasm JIT for Mono,
# and gex's changes as commits on top).
# MONO_REPO: the fork's repository URL. It has no public remote yet, so
